    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Implements the approved OWNER toolbar without a new server, API key, daemon, agent layer, or product-runtime mutation.\n\nBase: `333550e4a9d4754471c49d3573a370e559212451`\n\nVisible order:\n`ZORR MODE | Делай | Продолжить | Проверить | Стоп | ⋯`\n\nImplementation:\n- one dependency-free userscript scoped only to `https://chatgpt.com/*`\n- exact standard prompts bound to the four command buttons\n- `Стоп` only clicks a visible ChatGPT stop-generation control; no destructive fallback\n- overflow: Brainstorm, Constitution, Shared HQ, hide until reload\n- no fetch/XHR/WebSocket/@require/API key/telemetry/GitHub writes\n- one installation document using MIT open-source Violentmonkey\n- root regression test enforces the toolbar contract\n- design + execution plan included for durable recovery\n\nNo OWNER preference/profile learning. No changes to SALVADOR, Babylon, controller runtime, SHERIFF, communication automation, or Constitution.\n\nAcceptance: fresh `hq-validate` green on exact PR HEAD, exact 5-file scope, mergeable. Physical browser activation remains a separate local browser-security approval.",
